WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:09.177
Ringo tried to open the clam's shell.

2
00:00:09.178 --> 00:00:12.010
Then he had an idea.

3
00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:15.383
"Stand near the gap," Ringo yelled.

4
00:00:15.384 --> 00:00:17.875
"Your bodies are getting bigger.

5
00:00:17.876 --> 00:00:26.101
They will push the shell open!"

6
00:00:26.102 --> 00:00:28.325
Ringo was right.

7
00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:34.491
Soon everyone was free!

8
00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:39.069
They quickly swam up.

9
00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.613
"Hurry!" Ringo said.

10
00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:52.546
"We need to get off the planet."

11
00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:55.549
"Help!" Lucy cried.

12
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.677
"My jet pack won't work!

13
00:00:57.678 --> 00:01:03.338
The jets are jammed!"

14
00:01:03.339 --> 00:01:22.310
Ringo rushed over and grabbed Lucy's hand.

15
00:01:22.311 --> 00:01:27.022
They shot to the ship.

16
00:01:27.023 --> 00:01:31.916
They got there just in time!

17
00:01:31.917 --> 00:01:35.377
"Good work, Ringo!" Lucy said.

18
00:01:35.378 --> 00:01:38.311
"You saved Micro Planet!"

19
00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:53.514
Ringo grinned. "Being tiny isn't a bad thing!"

20
00:01:53.515 --> 00:02:04.876
They flew back to Space Patrol.

21
00:02:04.877 --> 00:02:08.927
"That mission made me hungry," Lucy said.

22
00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:18.298
"Me too," Ringo said.

23
00:02:18.299 --> 00:02:22.004
Everyone rushed to the dining room.

24
00:02:22.005 --> 00:02:31.128
Too late! The feast was over!

25
00:02:31.129 --> 00:02:33.870
They saw a message from Rosco.

26
00:02:33.871 --> 00:02:41.183
"I saved this just for you."

27
00:02:41.184 --> 00:02:43.551
Ringo lifted the pot lid.

28
00:02:43.552 --> 00:02:49.688
It was a sticky, gooey . . . clam pie.

29
00:02:49.689 --> 00:02:52.754
Ringo and Lucy looked at each other.

30
00:02:52.755 --> 00:03:13.907
"Ugh!" Lucy said. "Not more clams!"

